            <title>[IGNITE-8219]  B+Tree operation may result in an infinite loop in some case</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-8219</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;B+Tree operation may result in an infinite loop in case. Test&#160;DynamicIndexServerCoordinatorBasicSelfTest#testCreateIndexWithInlineSizePartitionedAtomic region size = 512Mb,&#160;KEY_BEFORE=10000, KEY_AFTER=20000&lt;/p&gt;</description>
